                        "glosses": [
                            "Of or pertaining to a lens."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4dcd39c6-23ac-330c-bc30-ce86908e8865",
                        "entry_id": "0b9fb84c-01ba-3d36-9237-7c2bb2e30d28",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Shaped like a biconvex lens."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "73186849-c28c-4d85-a277-79688a1363ee",
                                "sense_id": "4dcd39c6-23ac-330c-bc30-ce86908e8865",
                                "text": "The sporophyte foot is also characteristic: it is very broad and more or less lenticular or disciform, as broad or broader than the calyptra stalk[…]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c280815b-8e37-4454-89bf-403f44ffc322",
                                "sense_id": "4dcd39c6-23ac-330c-bc30-ce86908e8865",
                                "text": "The [Royal Albert] bridge itself has approach viaducts on each side, before two 455ft lenticular trusses span the main part of the river, which is 80ft below."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d660059d-0a79-3a31-b5ca-c4d0cb804309",
                        "entry_id": "0b9fb84c-01ba-3d36-9237-7c2bb2e30d28",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Relating to a lenticular image."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "18c4eff6-1ed8-4a73-aaf7-d3e53801d41f",
                                "sense_id": "d660059d-0a79-3a31-b5ca-c4d0cb804309",
                                "text": "lenticular photography"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "360f8fd1-55d7-4ab2-adde-da67dbc48a48",
                                "sense_id": "d660059d-0a79-3a31-b5ca-c4d0cb804309",
                                "text": "But establishment on the fringes of everyday practice doesn't mean lenticular photography is a failure. On the contrary, the process manifests resounding cultural success through its longevity."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "26282370-361f-3813-a7a4-89b211a0fc22",
                        "entry_id": "0b9fb84c-01ba-3d36-9237-7c2bb2e30d28",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Covered in lenticels."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
